  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>21</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>60</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>41</mn></math></p><p>On differentiating w.r.t. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>42</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>60</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>or</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;i.e., <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> is decreasing</p><p>and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;i.e.,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is increasing</p>"
